<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-LEADING FRENCH LEAGUE SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING FRENCH LEAGUE SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in the French first</p>
<p>division after Friday's matches:</p>
<p>12 - Stephane Guivarc'h (Rennes)</p>
<p>10 - David Zitelli (Strasbourg)</p>
<p>9 - Miladin Becanovic (Lille)</p>
<p>8 - Anton Drobnjak (Bastia), Anderson (Monaco)</p>
<p>7 - Alain Caveglia (Lyon), Leonardo (Paris SG), Japhet N'Doram</p>
<p>(Nantes)</p>
<p>6 - Victor Ikpeba (Monaco)</p>
<p>5 - Christopher Wreh (Guingamp), Jean-Pierre Papin (Bordeaux),</p>
<p>Moussa Saib (Auxerre)</p>
